The LLVM Project is a collection of modular and reusable compiler and
toolchain technologies.  This version adds support for the Arm Morello
prototype architecture (CHERI ported to ARMv8-A).

This port installs the LLVM core libraries (libLLVM) and tools such as
llc, opt and llvm-objdump into ${PREFIX}/llvm-morello.  The other
LLVM sub-projects are packaged separately and build against it.
